Subject: [PATCH] misc: fastrpc: isolate nabu SDSP mappings and wait for its PD

Experimental nabu-only replacement for the sensors remote-heap workaround.
Based on the alias and PDR approach in Kumar-Jy/linux at
739161a890128f23bd1aa679d8754a9ea299269e, with DMA handles kept separate,
range validation, import coverage and error-path unwinding. Preserve other
SoCs' SID encoding and DMA masks. No unverified physical carveout is used.
Physical remote-heap and secure imports are unsupported on this board;
hexagonrpcd's apps_mem uses ADD_PAGES instead. Requires matching nabu DT.

